BT 1 0 0 1 0 84.6 Tm /F2 12 Tf 13.8 TL 2.656892 Tw (Evidence note: nmap, grepcidr and datamash are not installed in the sandbox used to) Tj T* 0 Tw .453507 Tw (prepare this document and no live network was scanned. All outputs below were produced) Tj T* 0 Tw .816359 Tw (by really running the shown Bash/awk/sed/join commands on a synthetic 192.168.56.0/24) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.595236 Tw (lab dataset written in nmap -oG \(grepable\) format and modelled on Metasploitable-style) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.378299 Tw (targets. Before submission, repeat the nmap commands on your own authorized Kali lab) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.396828 Tw (and replace the data files; the pipeline code is unchanged. Commands are shown in a) Tj T* 0 Tw (monospaced font because the original paper has none.) Tj T* ET
