BT 1 0 0 1 0 70.8 Tm /F2 12 Tf 13.8 TL 4.315949 Tw (Requirements from the authorized scenario \(lab 192.168.56.0/24, written permission) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.298639 Tw (assumed\): R1 find live hosts \(nmap -sn, fping -a -g\); R2 list TCP/UDP ports \(nmap -sS,) Tj T* 0 Tw .443399 Tw (-sT, -sU\); R3 identify services and versions \(nmap -sV\); R4 fingerprint the OS \(nmap -O\);) Tj T* 0 Tw 8.503066 Tw (R5 record enumeration findings \(enum4linux -a, nbtscan, adb shell getprop,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.171963 Tw (rmi-dumpregistry, ncp-serverinfo, sdptool browse\); R6 trace every row to a scan session;) Tj T* 0 Tw (R7 reproduce results from raw files.) Tj T* ET
