BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.2 Tm /F2 12 Tf 13.8 TL .281474 Tw (Limitations: the speed-up \(about 24 times at 50 rows, about 900 times at 5,000 rows\) is for) Tj T* 0 Tw .301839 Tw (validation only; the scan itself is limited by the network, and nmap -T4 or --min-rate raises) Tj T* 0 Tw .261974 Tw (speed at the cost of dropped probes and possibly missed open ports, so such tuning needs a) Tj T* 0 Tw (re-check of results. Timings come from one run on a shared sandbox and will vary.) Tj T* ET
